#!/bin/bash
# DEBUG pass of the tier approx (the truths s_j ~ j^-2, j^-1.5), binary rewards, sphere, horizon
# 2000, 1 replication: 14 cells (7 arms per truth), one per task.  Checks the pipeline; no claim.
# Then:  python3 collect_regret.py binomial --tiers approx --designs sphere --horizon 2000 --replications 1 --out debug_binomial_approx
#        python3 verdict_regret.py --out debug_binomial_approx debug_binomial_approx
#$ -pe smp 1
#$ -q long
#$ -N debug_b_approx
#$ -t 1-14
#$ -tc 110
#$ -r n

module load python/3.12.15
cd $SGE_O_WORKDIR
python3 run_regret.py binomial --tiers approx --designs sphere --horizon 2000 --replications 1 --out debug_binomial_approx --chunk $SGE_TASK_ID --chunks 14
